[
  {
    "text": "Prioritize your own growth and self-empowerment—letting others' success inspire you, but don't let it undermine your own potential or your unique light.",
    "category": "motivation",
    "author": "growthbyvisuals",
    "sourceUrl": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DbX7S7SiIMs",
    "sourcePlatform": "instagram",
    "createdAt": "2026-09-22T07:48:05.619739+00:00"
  },
  {
    "text": "The core lesson is to begin with simple, unrefined actions (like drawing small visuals) and let them grow naturally, even when initial ideas seem flawed. This emphasizes the power of persistence and the importance of not being overwhelmed by internal overthinking, allowing small efforts to build lasting impact.",
    "category": "motivation",
    "author": "growthbyvisuals",
    "sourceUrl": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DbX7S7SiIMs",
    "sourcePlatform": "instagram",
    "createdAt": "2026-09-22T08:36:23.935179+00:00"
  },
  {
    "text": "This sequence highlights the power of mindset: the courage to face fears of loss, collapse, and inability by declaring 'What if I WIN?' as a foundation for resilience. It emphasizes that true strength lies in believing in the possibility of triumph, even when facing potential failures.",
    "category": "motivation",
    "author": "stoicwind (Creator/Speaker)",
    "sourceUrl": "https://www.instagram.com/reel/DP6NmipDEbr/",
    "sourcePlatform": "instagram",
    "createdAt": "2026-09-22T08:58:19.788134+00:00"
  },
  {
    "text": "Pride says 'I did it alone.'\nWisdom says 'I learned from others.'\nFear is 'what if.'\nFaith is 'even if.'\nRegret whispers 'I shouldn't have.'\nRedemption replies 'I'll do better.'\nHate says 'because of them.'\nLove says 'In spite of everything.",
    "category": "lesson",
    "author": "kisatsutaiofficial",
    "sourceUrl": "https://www.instagram.com/reel/DNiuJ8CM6pm/",
    "sourcePlatform": "instagram",
    "createdAt": "2026-09-22T09:44:45.973744+00:00"
  },
  {
    "text": "The direct quote is: \"Just do it. Don't wait. Don't overthink. Start. Today.\"\n\nThe underlying principle is: \"Won't dim your own glow\" (emphasizing self-empowerment through immediate action).",
    "category": "motivation",
    "author": "growthbyvisuals",
    "sourceUrl": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DbX7S7SiIMs",
    "sourcePlatform": "instagram",
    "createdAt": "2026-09-22T10:37:53.666920+00:00"
  },
